OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_InfoClerk::
	.string "Welcome to the MANDARIN GAME\n"
	.string "CORNER.\p"
	.string "Win coins at the machines, spend\n"
	.string "them next door at the PRIZE\l"
	.string "CORNER.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_Gentleman::
	.string "I have a system. It has cost me\n"
	.string "a great deal of money.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_OldMan::
	.string "Machines by the wall pay out. Do\n"
	.string "not ask me how I know.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_Sailor::
	.string "Came ashore with a month of pay.\n"
	.string "Leaving with a LEMONADE.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_Woman::
	.string "This one has not paid out all\n"
	.string "evening. It is due. It must be.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_CoinsAsk::
	.string "Fifty coins for 1000. Shall I?$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_CoinsThanks::
	.string "Fifty coins. Good luck in there.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_NoCase::
	.string "You will want a COIN CASE before\n"
	.string "you sit down at a machine.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_CoinsNo::
	.string "Watching is free, of course.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_CoinsBroke::
	.string "Come back when you have the\n"
	.string "money, friend.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_CoinsFull::
	.string "Your COIN CASE will not hold\n"
	.string "another one.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_CroupierLeft::
	.string "ROULETTE, the near table. One coin\n"
	.string "the spin, and the wheel is kind.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_CroupierRight::
	.string "ROULETTE, the far table. Three\n"
	.string "coins the spin.\p"
	.string "It pays better. It also takes\n"
	.string "rather more.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_FlipAttendant::
	.string "VOLTORB FLIP. Turn over every 2 and\n"
	.string "every 3 and the board is yours.\p"
	.string "The figures beside each row are what\n"
	.string "it holds and how many VOLTORB are\l"
	.string "hiding in it. Work it out.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_SlotPlay::
	.string "A slot machine. Play it?$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_SlotNoCase::
	.string "It is a slot machine. Without a\n"
	.string "COIN CASE there is nothing to\l"
	.string "play it with.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_GameCorner_Text_BrokenSlot::
	.string "OUT OF ORDER.\p"
	.string "Somebody has written UNLUCKY on\n"
	.string "the sign in marker pen.$"

